title: "DruidJS — A JavaScript Library for Dimensionality Reduction"
abstract: >-
  A JavaScript library for dimensionality reduction, providing dimensionality
  reduction methods, nearest-neighbor indices and clustering algorithms behind a
  single API, with WebAssembly kernels and a JavaScript fallback.
